<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has</p>
<p>issued 25 million American-style put warrants, in five equal</p>
<p>tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one index.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.OCT.96-19.DEC.97   PAYDATE	21.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT STG DDF	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  702.64</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> PUT 13	  625.0	 2.73 DEM	 13.60 PCT    39.0 X</p>
<p> PUT 14	  650.0	 3.59 DEM	 10.84 PCT    30.0 X</p>
<p> PUT 15	  675.0	 4.57 DEM	  8.20 PCT    23.0 X</p>
<p> PUT 16	  700.0	 5.82 DEM	  5.80 PCT    18.0 X</p>
<p> PUT 17	  725.0	 7.52 DEM	  3.83 PCT    14.0 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
